  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "決策與數據分析",
    "sub_ename": "DATA ANALYSIS FOR DECISION SUPPORT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將簡介資料分析的概念、相對應之理論方法。接者，透過不同領域的應用實例、軟體工具的使用和專案實作，讓學生有基礎的想法。最後，帶領學生一步步地學會如何運用這些工具解決實務上的問題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce the concepts, techniques of big data analysis and its applications in different scopes. In this course, we also apply the analysis tools such as Python to let students know how to realize the algorithms.  As a results, one can expect that students would utilize the tools to solve the practical problems around the world.",
    "pre_subname": "",
